Plugin Changelog
================

0.4.0

* redesign the console: menus Layer 7, Protection and AI, one layout for every module (status, tiles, tabs, logs)
* add Live Sessions with Block and Allow of websites, whole domains and IP addresses from the connection list
* add Web Control: wildcard website rules (*instagram.com), IP rules, per-device and temporary rules, allow exceptions
* add Application Control one-click categories and applications, content filtering (CFS) with safe search and known-bad IP lists, DPI-SSL for all HTTPS with exclusions
* add web access sign-in (login page, OPNsense users, LDAP or RADIUS) and policies for signed-in users
* add MD5, SHA-1 and SHA-256 malware lists and YARA virus signatures to the download antivirus, fed by the cloud server

0.3.0

* add AI service visibility and control (23 services identified by TLS/QUIC server name and DNS; allow, monitor or block; QUIC block)
* add AI content inspection: selective TLS inspection with a name-constrained CA and an ICAP data-loss scanner (payment cards, identity numbers, API keys, source code)
* add a tamper-evident AI audit log (masked snippets, hash chain, export, syslog, privacy notice)
* add download protection: file-type control and SHA-256 malware-hash reputation for HTTP and chosen HTTPS sites

0.2.0

* add MAC binding (pf ether rules, strict mode, device discovery, spoof alerts, static ARP)
* add GeoIP filtering (block/allow-only countries, per interface, exceptions) and country tags on flows

0.1.0

* initial release
